# Super-admin console. Access is Apache Basic auth, NOT Google sign-in.
#
# Setup (see README "Super-admin"):
#   1. php scripts/admin-password.php   -> prints a line for the password file
#   2. Save it OUTSIDE the web root, e.g. /home/you/quizmyclass-secrets/.htpasswd
#   3. Replace the AuthUserFile path below with that absolute path.
#
# Until the path is correct Apache returns a 500 error here, so the console stays closed.
AuthType Basic
AuthName "QuizMyClass administration"
AuthUserFile "/REPLACE/WITH/ABSOLUTE/PATH/OUTSIDE/WEB/ROOT/.htpasswd"
Require valid-user

Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.php
